VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fNf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bcaa3a81-4330-447f-ad47-766151b56fae","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"名前パッと出てこないけど、デッキ構築タワーディフェンスの羊増えまくるの思い出した ＞300匹で総攻撃","ts":"1619753052.170200","thread_ts":"1619753052.170200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"52Z5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4377ed40-6004-4027-9f4d-ca72894a80ef","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"「個体管理番号300のスライムが英雄となって299匹のスライムたちを救う旅」なんてのも思いついた\nラスボス戦は300匹で総攻撃ですね！アツい。","ts":"1619752904.168700","edited":{"user":"UKHUVMBJR","ts":"1619752930.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"grin","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4UU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c095afe-8578-438d-abb1-ba4fd1476c7c","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"「◎◎◎数字」ってタイトルからだと今流行のバトロワも連想できますね\n300匹のスライムたちで争って生き残れ！的な…","ts":"1619752761.167900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Il2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8efbfea3-81fe-4fa4-a1c1-836eded33a1a","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"もう一つ捻ったものとしては、「弱小スライム300匹軍団でモンスター軍団に挑む！」とか。\n不死性だけがとりえの弱小スライム軍団を鍛えて強大なモンスターに打ち勝つ…という流れで","ts":"1619752679.167300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ou=k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"766907e3-aaa3-47a6-a355-713cb415cfdb","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"火に炙って火スライム、酸に浸して酸性スライム…\nポケモンとの差別化としてどんな処置をしても心が傷まないのがポイントですねw","ts":"1619752612.166300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xfO0T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7661e0a0-26b5-4dec-8439-bc1e07681f25","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"そうですね、自分もらぁさんとかと同じく「300種類のスライムを集めよう！」なゲームを思いつきましたね\n各地で発見したり、合成したり","ts